  "title": "Intracranial recordings using BCI2000 and the CorTec BrainInterchange",
  "description": "This dataset contains intracranial recordings acquired in humans using the CorTec BrainInterchange implantable device together with BCI2000 software. It supports the development of an ecosystem of technology and protocols for adaptive neuromodulation research. The data are shared in BIDS format with iEEG recordings.",
